==Strategy==
If you don't want to fight this stage normally, you can cheese this stage. Use [[Green Shell Cat]] to pin Corrupted Valkyrie to the base, use [[Macho Crystal Cat]] to knockback the Manic Lion, and then use the Breakerblast Cannon along with Cannon Start combos like [[Yesterday's Enemy (Combo)|Yesterday's Enemy]] to push both enemies back. Combine this with other rushers like [[Bullet Train Cat]] for a quick win.

Your main goal is to remove Corrupted Valkyrie as fast as possible for a huge cash boost as well as to make the Bahamut fight easier. Lure her to your base and use meatshields as well as Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to destroy her quickly. With Bahamut's Explosion, the Manic Lion Cat also suffers serious damage. If your Bahamut is too weak, add [[Fishman Cat]] to deal the remaining damage needed.

The best way to fight Raging Bahamut here is to use units like [[Cyberpunk Cat]] to stop his movement. Add meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] to protect your Cyberpunk during his downtime and you're good until the Manic Lions come in. Units like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]], [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]], and [[Pizza Cat]] are highly recommended to fend them off. If you ran Fishman, he also works for quick damage, although his Single Target leaves a lot to be desired if the Lions come in heavy packs.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
Generally, any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] that has a [[Special Abilities|special ability]] against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] or [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies should do well here. Below are more specified examples of good [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] to use in this stage.
*[[Strike Unit R.E.I. (Uber Rare Cat)|Strike Unit R.E.I.]]: Makes this stage a joke if you can handle the Manic Lion Cats off long enough. You don't even have to use a [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]] if your other units are strong enough.
*[[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]]: Another unit that makes this stage basically a joke. Shreds the Manic Lion Cats while also doing good damage to Corrupted Valkyrie/Raging Bahamut Cat.
*[[Saber (Uber Rare Cat)|Saber]]: Similar to Strike Unit R.E.I., except her [[Long Distance]] attacks can pierce through the Manic Lion Cats and hit Corrupted Valkyrie/Raging Bahamut Cat, which is useful.
*[[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|Blanka]]: A [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] with [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies and can rebound easily after getting hit by anything.
*[[Chun-Li (Uber Rare Cat)|Chun-Li]]: Can [[Knockback|knockback]] Alien enemies and has high DPS to help take out Corrupted Valkyrie before Raging Bahamut Cat appears.
*[[Count Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Count Yukimura]]: Similar to Blanka.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]: Same as Count Yukimura, albeit less effective.
*[[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine/Ultimate Windy α]]: Is helpful for both bosses as she can one-shot Corrupted Valkyrie and is a huge help against Raging Bahamut.

